#: ../../files/quota.rst:3
msgid "Storage quota"
msgstr "Cuóta stórála"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:5
msgid ""
"Your Nextcloud administrator can set a storage quota for your account. Open "
"your Personal settings page to see your quota and how much storage you have "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le do riarthóir Nextcloud cuóta stórála a shocrú do do chuntas. "
"Oscail do leathanach socruithe pearsanta chun do chuóta a fheiceáil, chomh "
"maith leis an méid stórála atá in úsáid agat."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:9
msgid "Storage quota indicator on the Personal page"
msgstr "Táscaire cuóta stórála ar an leathanach Pearsanta"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:12
msgid "It may be helpful to understand how your quota is calculated."
msgstr ""
"B’fhéidir go mbeadh sé ina chuidiú tuiscint a fháil ar an gcaoi a ríomhtar "
"do chuóta."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:14
msgid ""
"Metadata such as thumbnails, temporary files, caches, and encryption keys "
"can use disk space without counting against your user quota. Some apps store"
" data in the database, such as the Calendar and Contacts apps. This data is "
"not included in the file-storage quota."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le meiteashonraí – ar nós mioníomhánna, comhaid shealadacha, "
"taiscechomhaid agus eochracha criptithe – spás diosca a úsáid gan a bheith á"
" gcur san áireamh i gcoinne do chuóta úsáideora. Stórálann roinnt aipeanna "
"sonraí sa bhunachar sonraí, mar shampla na haipeanna Féilire agus "
"Teagmhálacha. Ní chuirtear na sonraí seo san áireamh sa chuóta stórála "
"comhad."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:19
msgid ""
"When other users share files with you, the shared files normally count "
"against the original owner's quota. When you share a folder and allow other "
"users or groups to upload or edit files in it, those files count against "
"your quota. When you re-share files shared with you, the re-share normally "
"continues to count against the original owner's quota."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a roinneann úsáideoirí eile comhaid leat, áirítear na comhaid roinnte "
"sin de ghnáth i gcoinne chuóta an úinéara bhunaidh. Nuair a roinneann tú "
"fillteán agus nuair a thugann tú cead d’úsáideoirí nó do ghrúpaí eile "
"comhaid a uaslódáil nó a chur in eagar ann, áirítear na comhaid sin i "
"gcoinne do chuóta féin. Nuair a athroinneann tú comhaid a roinneadh leat, "
"leanann an t-athroinnt de ghnáth de bheith á áireamh i gcoinne chuóta an "
"úinéara bhunaidh."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:25
msgid ""
"Encrypted files can use more physical storage than unencrypted files. The "
"quota calculation uses the file size reported by Nextcloud's storage layer."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le comhaid chriptithe níos mó stórála fisiciúla a úsáid ná comhaid"
" neamhchriptithe. Úsáideann an ríomh cuótaí méid an chomhaid mar a "
"thuairiscíonn ciseal stórála Nextcloud é."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:28
msgid ""
"When the Versions app is enabled, older file versions are managed separately"
" from the normal storage quota according to the app's retention and storage "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn an aip Versions cumasaithe, déantar leaganacha comhaid níos "
"sine a bhainistiú ar leithligh ón gcuóta stórála gnáth, i gcomhréir le "
"rialacha coinneála agus stórála na haipe."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:32
msgid ""
"If you create a public share through a URL and allow uploads, uploaded files"
" count against your quota."
msgstr ""
"Má chruthaíonn tú comhroinnt phoiblí trí URL agus má cheadaíonn tú comhaid a"
" uaslódáil, áireofar na comhaid a uaslódáiltear i gcoinne do chuóta."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:36
msgid "Deleted files and the trash bin"
msgstr "Comhaid scriosta agus an bosca bruscair"

#: ../../files/quota.rst:38
msgid ""
"Files and folders in your trash bin do not count against your normal storage"
" quota. The trash bin nevertheless has its own storage limit."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirtear comhaid agus filléáin atá i do bhosca bruscair san áireamh i "
"gcoinne do ghnáthchuóta stórála. Bíonn a theorainn stórála féin ag an mbosca"
" bruscair, áfach."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:41
msgid ""
"For accounts with a quota, the default amount of space available to the "
"trash bin is calculated as 50% of the account's remaining quota space. This "
"is calculated after the account's active files have been taken into account;"
" it is not 50% of the total quota."
msgstr ""
"I gcás cuntas a bhfuil cuóta acu, ríomhtar an méid spáis réamhshocraithe atá"
" ar fáil don bhosca bruscair mar 50% den spás atá fágtha sa chuóta. Déantar "
"an ríomh seo tar éis comhaid ghníomhacha an chuntais a chur san áireamh; ní "
"hé 50% den chuóta iomlán atá i gceist."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:46
msgid ""
"For accounts without a quota, the default trash-bin limit is calculated "
"using available filesystem space instead. An administrator can configure a "
"global or per-account trash-bin size that overrides the calculated default."
msgstr ""
"I gcás cuntas gan chuóta, ríomhtar an teorainn réamhshocraithe don bhruscar "
"ag baint úsáide as an spás córais comhad atá ar fáil ina ionad. Is féidir le"
" riarthóir méid bruscair domhanda nó in aghaidh an chuntais a chumrú a "
"sháraíonn an réamhshocrú ríofa."

#: ../../files/quota.rst:50
msgid ""
"Your administrator can also configure minimum and maximum trash-bin "
"retention periods, or disable automatic expiration. See the `Deleted Files "
"section of the Administrator Manual "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>`_"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le do riarthóir tréimhsí íosta agus uasta a shocrú chun comhaid a "
"choinneáil sa bhosca bruscair, nó an próiseas a scriosann comhaid go "
"huathoibríoch tar éis tréimhse áirithe a dhíchumasú. Féach an rannán "
"`Comhaid Scriosta i Lámhleabhar an Riarthóra "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>`_"
" chun tuilleadh sonraí a fháil."
